1800
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:05,046
Crossing over high mountains and valleys

5407
00:00:05,407 --> 00:00:08,613
A ninja's body is like a plane, flying freely across the sky

8865
00:00:08,865 --> 00:00:12,298
Honest and kind Hattori-kun brings joy to everyone

12452
00:00:12,452 --> 00:00:15,632
Eyes wide and round, with lips held tight

15965
00:00:15,965 --> 00:00:19,366
Masking his face, his cheeks puffed up

19532
00:00:19,532 --> 00:00:22,690
Catching villains with agile moves as swift as lightning

22990
00:00:22,990 --> 00:00:26,457
Catching bad guys with quirky tricks just like magic

26810
00:00:26,810 --> 00:00:29,836
Speaking like poetry, polite and spirited

31755
00:00:31,755 --> 00:00:34,392
"Shinzo in Danger"

36249
00:00:36,249 --> 00:00:38,115
"Kidnapping Suspect Finally Captured"

38156
00:00:38,156 --> 00:00:40,874
"Ten-Year-Old Narrowly Escapes Evil Clutches!"

40930
00:00:40,930 --> 00:00:43,201
Kenichi, you have to be careful

43374
00:00:43,374 --> 00:00:45,255
I'm very careful, so it should be fine

45295
00:00:45,295 --> 00:00:46,573
But Shishimaru is another story

46614
00:00:46,614 --> 00:00:48,848
Because when there's food, he forgets everything else

55166
00:00:55,166 --> 00:00:56,299
Mom!

59000
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,069
We're back!

60110
00:01:00,110 --> 00:01:01,020
Kenichi

61060
00:01:01,060 --> 00:01:03,169
Did you see Shinzo on your way?

63210
00:01:03,210 --> 00:01:04,156
No, I didn't

64423
00:01:04,423 --> 00:01:05,240
Well, then

65280
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:06,929
I asked Shinzo to run an errand for me

66969
00:01:06,969 --> 00:01:08,254
And he's still not back yet

68295
00:01:08,295 --> 00:01:09,959
He went shopping all by himself?

70006
00:01:10,006 --> 00:01:12,151
Yes, he was so thoughtful and offered to help me

72292
00:01:12,292 --> 00:01:14,380
Maybe he saw something interesting on the way

74420
00:01:14,420 --> 00:01:15,765
and lost track of time

75980
00:01:15,980 --> 00:01:17,089
Oh, the phone is ringing

77534
00:01:17,534 --> 00:01:18,638
Hello, who is this?

80412
00:01:20,412 --> 00:01:21,519
Shinzo?

81560
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:23,689
Kenichi, this is bad!

83730
00:01:23,730 --> 00:01:24,644
Hello, Shinzo?

84684
00:01:24,684 --> 00:01:26,357
What's wrong? What happened?

86410
00:01:26,410 --> 00:01:28,743
Stop asking questions, I just need money right now

88783
00:01:28,783 --> 00:01:30,498
Just hurry up and get the money ready for me!

90539
00:01:30,539 --> 00:01:32,683
What did you say? Who on earth are you?

93000
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:34,120
Hello, Shinzo!

94161
00:01:34,161 --> 00:01:35,454
I need money!

95781
00:01:35,781 --> 00:01:37,507
He wants money? Oh no, this is bad

98788
00:01:38,788 --> 00:01:40,308
I have to hang up now

100349
00:01:40,349 --> 00:01:42,015
I only have fifty cents on me

102055
00:01:42,055 --> 00:01:44,240
I can't stay on the phone anymore

104281
00:01:44,281 --> 00:01:46,712
If I can't raise this money today

106752
00:01:46,752 --> 00:01:49,262
Then I'll really have to declare bankruptcy, please help me

109303
00:01:49,303 --> 00:01:50,277
Okay?

110312
00:01:50,312 --> 00:01:51,508
Please help me!

112580
00:01:52,580 --> 00:01:54,060
What's wrong?

114460
00:01:54,460 --> 00:01:56,199
Shinzo, he...

116240
00:01:56,240 --> 00:01:58,286
What? Kenichi, what on earth happened?

118327
00:01:58,327 --> 00:01:59,664
I heard Shinzo crying over there

119704
00:01:59,704 --> 00:02:01,796
And a man kept demanding money from him

121837
00:02:01,837 --> 00:02:03,641
What, they want money?

123682
00:02:03,682 --> 00:02:05,266
Could it be a kidnapping?

125565
00:02:05,565 --> 00:02:08,168
That man's voice sounded really menacing and scary

128215
00:02:08,215 --> 00:02:09,373
Oh dear, this is terrible!

129414
00:02:09,414 --> 00:02:11,293
Quick, call the police station and report it!

131334
00:02:11,334 --> 00:02:13,392
Absolutely not! If we report it to the police

133432
00:02:13,432 --> 00:02:15,422
Shinzo's life will be in danger!

135769
00:02:15,769 --> 00:02:18,545
So where on earth did Shinzo go shopping?

138586
00:02:18,586 --> 00:02:20,673
- I sent him to the fishmonger
- Yan...

140713
00:02:20,713 --> 00:02:22,642
Hey... wait for me!

143836
00:02:23,836 --> 00:02:25,377
Huh, he's not Shinzo?

145418
00:02:25,418 --> 00:02:27,320
Did you come to do some shopping for your family?

148467
00:02:28,467 --> 00:02:29,752
Such a good boy

150807
00:02:30,807 --> 00:02:32,748
Teacher...

153001
00:02:33,001 --> 00:02:34,964
Oh dear, please don't cry...

155005
00:02:35,005 --> 00:02:35,951
I beg of you, be considerate

155992
00:02:35,992 --> 00:02:37,638
Please don't cry, okay?

157925
00:02:37,925 --> 00:02:38,934
There we go

158975
00:02:38,975 --> 00:02:41,369
So, what happened? Tell your teacher, okay?

161410
00:02:41,410 --> 00:02:44,010
I lost my wallet, it had some money in it

164051
00:02:44,051 --> 00:02:46,152
Oh dear, how could you be so careless and lose your wallet?

166193
00:02:46,193 --> 00:02:48,538
Alright, let your teacher help you find it, okay?

169293
00:02:49,293 --> 00:02:50,940
Come on, let's head back

170980
00:02:50,980 --> 00:02:53,333
If we retrace our steps, we're sure to find your wallet

178575
00:02:58,575 --> 00:02:59,392
Shinzo!

179432
00:02:59,432 --> 00:03:01,533
Why did you take a route like this to go shopping?

181580
00:03:01,580 --> 00:03:02,434
Yeah

182508
00:03:02,508 --> 00:03:04,213
How are you? Hey, Shinzo!

184253
00:03:04,253 --> 00:03:06,352
Hey, Shinzo, wait for me, will you?

186432
00:03:06,432 --> 00:03:07,672
Yan...

187872
00:03:07,872 --> 00:03:09,192
Wait for me...

190695
00:03:10,695 --> 00:03:12,911
-Yan...
-Wait for me...

196315
00:03:16,315 --> 00:03:17,674
Is something wrong?

198020
00:03:18,020 --> 00:03:19,709
When a ninja gets kidnapped

199749
00:03:19,749 --> 00:03:22,256
They'll definitely leave a mark so someone can rescue them

202296
00:03:22,296 --> 00:03:24,365
Like leaving little stones behind

204405
00:03:24,405 --> 00:03:25,992
To show they passed through here

206032
00:03:26,032 --> 00:03:28,952
But I haven't found any marks like that at all

208992
00:03:28,992 --> 00:03:30,462
Maybe it was too dangerous at the time

210502
00:03:30,502 --> 00:03:33,060
And Shinzo didn't have any chance to leave a mark

215394
00:03:35,394 --> 00:03:37,352
Alright, let's pull ourselves together

217392
00:03:37,392 --> 00:03:38,501
Yan...

227175
00:03:47,175 --> 00:03:48,895
Yan...

234082
00:03:54,082 --> 00:03:55,402
I don't want to...

235442
00:03:55,442 --> 00:03:57,152
I want to buy a toy!

238691
00:03:58,691 --> 00:04:00,285
Why is that kid crying so loudly?

240325
00:04:00,325 --> 00:04:02,478
He's almost as terrifying as Shinzo

243672
00:04:03,672 --> 00:04:05,260
We've searched for so long and still haven't found it

245300
00:04:05,300 --> 00:04:07,373
I think someone must have picked up the wallet already

247414
00:04:07,414 --> 00:04:08,977
My brother is definitely going to scold me

249018
00:04:09,018 --> 00:04:10,312
Don't worry, I'll explain it to him for you

250352
00:04:10,352 --> 00:04:11,352
It's no use!

251521
00:04:11,521 --> 00:04:13,141
Well, it might work out

253182
00:04:13,182 --> 00:04:15,427
Let me come with you to give it a try, okay?

256842
00:04:16,842 --> 00:04:18,429
Yan...

261475
00:04:21,475 --> 00:04:23,727
Shishimaru, did you find any clues?

266892
00:04:26,892 --> 00:04:27,999
Step right up...

268039
00:04:28,039 --> 00:04:30,112
Delicious, fragrant barbecue!

270152
00:04:30,152 --> 00:04:31,922
Get it before it's gone!

275378
00:04:35,378 --> 00:04:36,392
Hattori-kun

276432
00:04:36,432 --> 00:04:38,458
I'm exhausted, I can't walk anymore

278499
00:04:38,499 --> 00:04:40,997
If the suspect calls to extort us again

281037
00:04:41,037 --> 00:04:42,221
Use your ninjutsu

282262
00:04:42,262 --> 00:04:44,152
and find a way to track him down

285192
00:04:45,192 --> 00:04:46,074
Kenichi

286150
00:04:46,150 --> 00:04:48,594
I'm really sorry Shinzo dragged you into this

289896
00:04:49,896 --> 00:04:50,489
Hattori-kun

290529
00:04:50,529 --> 00:04:52,081
Look, isn't this Mom's wallet?

292122
00:04:52,122 --> 00:04:54,018
Yes... it's Mom's wallet

294059
00:04:54,059 --> 00:04:55,650
That means...

296267
00:04:56,267 --> 00:04:59,162
Shinzo must be somewhere around here

303278
00:05:03,278 --> 00:05:04,475
It's Shinzo!

304665
00:05:04,665 --> 00:05:05,649
Found him!

305690
00:05:05,690 --> 00:05:06,782
Found him!

308255
00:05:08,255 --> 00:05:10,095
I'm so hungry

310135
00:05:10,135 --> 00:05:11,495
Don't you worry

311536
00:05:11,536 --> 00:05:14,199
If you need to buy something, Teacher can cover it for you first

314881
00:05:14,881 --> 00:05:16,701
Let me make a phone call first, okay?

317088
00:05:17,088 --> 00:05:18,808
Oh no, he's going to make a call again

318848
00:05:18,848 --> 00:05:20,135
Now's our chance!

320175
00:05:20,175 --> 00:05:21,872
I'll capture the culprit

321912
00:05:21,912 --> 00:05:23,625
You take care of Shinzo, okay?

323666
00:05:23,666 --> 00:05:25,800
-All right, got it
-Yan...

331925
00:05:31,925 --> 00:05:33,773
It's Smoke Bomb Ninja Technique!

335775
00:05:35,775 --> 00:05:37,749
Help! Ouch...

341234
00:05:41,234 --> 00:05:42,617
Why did this happen?

342811
00:05:42,811 --> 00:05:44,441
This is the end for you!

344713
00:05:44,713 --> 00:05:46,294
Hattori-kun did a great job!

346334
00:05:46,334 --> 00:05:48,953
Shinzo is safe and sound now

348994
00:05:48,994 --> 00:05:51,197
You can't bully Teacher like this!

351237
00:05:51,237 --> 00:05:53,097
Teacher!

353425
00:05:53,425 --> 00:05:55,159
-Teacher?
-Teacher?

357326
00:05:57,326 --> 00:05:59,953
Teacher! Teacher!

363433
00:06:03,433 --> 00:06:05,962
I dropped my wallet, and Teacher helped me find it!

366002
00:06:06,002 --> 00:06:08,529
Treating him like this is so rude!

370039
00:06:10,039 --> 00:06:11,790
Oh dear, don't cry

371830
00:06:11,830 --> 00:06:13,818
Teacher's eardrums haven't burst yet!

378718
00:06:18,718 --> 00:06:20,432
Quiet!

381798
00:06:21,798 --> 00:06:23,672
We really blamed an innocent person

383712
00:06:23,712 --> 00:06:25,872
We're so sorry, Teacher!

388802
00:06:28,802 --> 00:06:31,333
"It's Not Easy Being the Lead"

399727
00:06:39,727 --> 00:06:41,148
No matter how I swing, it doesn't look right

401189
00:06:41,189 --> 00:06:42,632
Maybe like this?

403542
00:06:43,542 --> 00:06:45,475
Still doesn't look quite right

405515
00:06:45,515 --> 00:06:46,236
That's it!

406395
00:06:46,395 --> 00:06:47,451
That's right!

407492
00:06:47,492 --> 00:06:48,875
Kenichi

409495
00:06:49,495 --> 00:06:51,792
I have no idea what you're doing right now

412254
00:06:52,254 --> 00:06:53,430
You know...

413470
00:06:53,470 --> 00:06:55,801
Our school's holding a festival soon

415881
00:06:55,881 --> 00:06:57,912
So what if they're having a festival?

417952
00:06:57,952 --> 00:06:59,361
What does that have to do with swordsmanship practice?

419402
00:06:59,402 --> 00:07:00,927
Our class has decided...

420967
00:07:00,967 --> 00:07:03,072
to put on a period play, "Princess Apricot Blossom"

423113
00:07:03,113 --> 00:07:04,151
You know, in that play...

424192
00:07:04,192 --> 00:07:05,791
there's a ninja with incredible skills

425832
00:07:05,832 --> 00:07:08,448
named Yukimao, and that's the role I'm playing!

429551
00:07:09,551 --> 00:07:11,483
Needless to say, the one playing Princess Apricot Blossom...

431524
00:07:11,524 --> 00:07:14,598
is obviously Yumeko! She's definitely pretty enough

434918
00:07:14,918 --> 00:07:17,763
Come on... Hattori-kun, teach me swordsmanship already!

437962
00:07:17,962 --> 00:07:20,558
Swordsmanship is sacred to a ninja

440599
00:07:20,599 --> 00:07:21,725
-Exactly
-You're just learning it just for acting

441765
00:07:21,765 --> 00:07:23,199
I cannot teach you

443317
00:07:23,317 --> 00:07:24,925
Don't turn me down!

444966
00:07:24,966 --> 00:07:26,813
Come on, teach me a couple moves, hurry!

446853
00:07:26,853 --> 00:07:29,356
How could anyone master it by just dabbling?

449396
00:07:29,396 --> 00:07:32,285
A true ninja only gains great skill through hard training!

452326
00:07:32,326 --> 00:07:33,839
Make an exception just this once!

453929
00:07:33,929 --> 00:07:36,152
Even though Kenichi is my good friend...

456192
00:07:36,192 --> 00:07:38,632
I still cannot break my rules

458672
00:07:38,672 --> 00:07:40,112
-Hattori-kun!
-Yan...

460152
00:07:40,152 --> 00:07:41,978
You're really too stingy!

466714
00:07:46,714 --> 00:07:47,333
What's the matter?

467374
00:07:47,374 --> 00:07:49,176
That's it, I'll ask Shishimaru

469217
00:07:49,217 --> 00:07:50,146
If you teach me

470187
00:07:50,187 --> 00:07:52,153
I'll treat you to all my snacks this afternoon

472201
00:07:52,201 --> 00:07:53,887
All right, it's a deal!

487165
00:08:07,165 --> 00:08:08,190
Watch out!

497568
00:08:17,568 --> 00:08:18,975
Don't run!

503341
00:08:23,341 --> 00:08:24,232
"Yukimao"

504272
00:08:24,272 --> 00:08:26,952
"I challenge you to a duel to settle this once and for all"

506992
00:08:26,992 --> 00:08:28,702
"Meet me at the park at dusk"

508742
00:08:28,742 --> 00:08:31,093
"Don't bring Hattori-kun along. Kemumaki"

511132
00:08:31,132 --> 00:08:33,443
Ah, so he dares challenge me, does he?

513484
00:08:33,484 --> 00:08:35,698
Fine, I accept!

519652
00:08:39,652 --> 00:08:41,284
You're telling me not to accept?

522096
00:08:42,096 --> 00:08:44,992
No way, I'm Ninja Yukimao now!

525032
00:08:45,032 --> 00:08:47,152
So I'm not afraid of Kemumaki at all

527827
00:08:47,827 --> 00:08:50,075
Kemumaki is from the Koga school

530384
00:08:50,384 --> 00:08:52,185
No matter how skilled he is

532225
00:08:52,225 --> 00:08:53,812
having trained in swordsmanship for so long

533852
00:08:53,852 --> 00:08:55,792
I'm sure I can beat him

537224
00:08:57,224 --> 00:08:58,557
Shishimaru, listen up

538598
00:08:58,598 --> 00:09:00,231
You can't tell Hattori-kun

540271
00:09:00,271 --> 00:09:01,552
If you tell him

541592
00:09:01,592 --> 00:09:03,494
I won't give you my afternoon snacks

543534
00:09:03,534 --> 00:09:04,427
Got it?

548571
00:09:08,571 --> 00:09:09,982
Shishimaru, what's wrong?

550022
00:09:10,022 --> 00:09:10,982
N-Nothing...

559092
00:09:19,092 --> 00:09:20,466
He's still not here yet

560546
00:09:20,546 --> 00:09:23,512
Kagechiyo, did you actually
deliver the challenge letter to him?

563552
00:09:23,552 --> 00:09:25,455
Of course I did, via express delivery!

565496
00:09:25,496 --> 00:09:26,663
Express delivery?

571892
00:09:31,892 --> 00:09:33,901
Kenichi, so you actually came?

573942
00:09:33,942 --> 00:09:35,672
Listen here, I'm not Kenichi

575712
00:09:35,712 --> 00:09:37,272
I am Ninja Yukimao!

577845
00:09:37,845 --> 00:09:41,070
You've got the posture down pretty well. All right then

582986
00:09:42,986 --> 00:09:44,340
Bring it on!

584380
00:09:44,380 --> 00:09:46,360
How dare you look down on me!

586401
00:09:46,401 --> 00:09:47,877
Time to teach you a lesson!

593485
00:09:53,485 --> 00:09:54,939
Kenichi, do you give up yet?

594987
00:09:54,987 --> 00:09:57,152
Damn it, you're so mean!

599437
00:09:59,437 --> 00:10:00,512
Yan...

601297
00:10:01,297 --> 00:10:03,097
That's Kemumaki!

605388
00:10:05,388 --> 00:10:06,494
Do you admit defeat?

606535
00:10:06,535 --> 00:10:07,699
Come on, hurry up!

611217
00:10:11,217 --> 00:10:12,227
Here I come!

620830
00:10:20,830 --> 00:10:21,976
He got away!

622083
00:10:22,083 --> 00:10:24,282
Here's my chance! Watch this!

627332
00:10:27,332 --> 00:10:28,688
What's going on?

633620
00:10:33,620 --> 00:10:35,352
Wonder where Hattori-kun went...

635667
00:10:35,667 --> 00:10:36,772
Are you scared of me?

636812
00:10:36,812 --> 00:10:37,722
What?

637762
00:10:37,762 --> 00:10:39,947
I'm definitely going to take you down!

640187
00:10:40,187 --> 00:10:41,327
Take that!

642979
00:10:42,979 --> 00:10:45,100
Oh no, he caught me off guard!

649604
00:10:49,604 --> 00:10:52,032
Didn't expect Kenichi to be so tough!

652254
00:10:52,254 --> 00:10:53,325
Yumeko?

653565
00:10:53,565 --> 00:10:55,070
Why are you two fighting?

655111
00:10:55,111 --> 00:10:56,792
No, the school show is coming up soon, after all

656832
00:10:56,832 --> 00:10:58,852
I'm just helping Kenichi practice his swordplay

658892
00:10:58,892 --> 00:11:00,312
Right, Kenichi?

661538
00:11:01,538 --> 00:11:02,895
He's so crafty

662935
00:11:02,935 --> 00:11:04,335
Oh, so that's why?

664375
00:11:04,375 --> 00:11:06,121
Kemumaki is such a good friend

666162
00:11:06,162 --> 00:11:08,991
Darn it, if not for Hattori-kun, you'd be in big trouble

670213
00:11:10,213 --> 00:11:12,934
Now, make sure you do your best at the show later, okay?

672975
00:11:12,975 --> 00:11:14,555
I definitely will

674740
00:11:14,740 --> 00:11:16,402
Yan...

683437
00:11:23,437 --> 00:11:24,931
There's so much to see!

692733
00:11:32,733 --> 00:11:34,092
Why are they laughing at me?

694133
00:11:34,133 --> 00:11:37,552
I followed the sword technique Shishimaru taught me to the letter

698569
00:11:38,569 --> 00:11:39,569
Yay...

699609
00:11:39,609 --> 00:11:41,508
Why did you learn dog style of all things?

701556
00:11:41,556 --> 00:11:42,700
Now it's turned into a comedy

702740
00:11:42,740 --> 00:11:44,872
That's not how the script goes at all

704992
00:11:44,992 --> 00:11:46,009
That's right

706282
00:11:46,282 --> 00:11:48,666
By the way, could you do me a favor?

709314
00:11:49,314 --> 00:11:51,728
Yumeko, are you really letting me play the role?

712679
00:11:52,679 --> 00:11:54,754
- Hey!
- Princess Apricot Blossom!

715080
00:11:55,080 --> 00:11:56,334
- Help me!
- Come down quickly!

716375
00:11:56,375 --> 00:11:57,740
I'll catch you, come on!

717787
00:11:57,787 --> 00:11:59,614
Ninja, here I come!

719697
00:11:59,697 --> 00:12:01,455
Ouch... Yumeko...

721496
00:12:01,496 --> 00:12:02,796
Why are you suddenly so heavy?

722837
00:12:02,837 --> 00:12:04,217
Kenichi, you've got the wrong person

724257
00:12:04,257 --> 00:12:06,931
- It's me
- Oh, it was the chubby girl?

732115
00:12:12,115 --> 00:12:14,544
Being the lead at the school show really isn't easy

734585
00:12:14,585 --> 00:12:17,655
And getting treated like a clown on top of that, wow

737915
00:12:17,915 --> 00:12:17,915
- Yay...
- Yay...

745778
00:12:25,778 --> 00:12:27,781
"The Chestnut Gathering Commotion"

757861
00:12:37,861 --> 00:12:39,040
Hey, how's it going?

759081
00:12:39,081 --> 00:12:41,008
Hattori-kun, have you found any yet?

761341
00:12:41,341 --> 00:12:42,961
Not yet, haven't found any

766914
00:12:46,914 --> 00:12:49,540
Hey, do you know
what on earth they're looking for?

769581
00:12:49,581 --> 00:12:50,301
No idea

770342
00:12:50,342 --> 00:12:52,251
I believe around our house

772292
00:12:52,292 --> 00:12:53,921
there definitely won't be any chestnuts

774527
00:12:54,527 --> 00:12:56,631
Come and buy, great deal!

777711
00:12:57,711 --> 00:12:59,191
They have chestnuts!

779583
00:12:59,583 --> 00:13:02,272
Mom, make us chestnut rice, please

782312
00:13:02,312 --> 00:13:03,491
That sounds good

784467
00:13:04,467 --> 00:13:06,083
But they're really too expensive

786123
00:13:06,123 --> 00:13:07,814
Let's wait until chestnuts are cheaper to buy them

787855
00:13:07,855 --> 00:13:09,489
So stingy

790840
00:13:10,840 --> 00:13:13,301
Chestnut rice and chestnut cake are both so delicious, though

793341
00:13:13,341 --> 00:13:15,007
I really want to eat chestnuts

796457
00:13:16,457 --> 00:13:18,208
The sparrows are lining up

798342
00:13:18,342 --> 00:13:20,237
Alright, let me chat with the sparrows first

800278
00:13:20,278 --> 00:13:21,325
Chat?

802721
00:13:22,721 --> 00:13:24,578
Ninja Technique: Sparrow Communication

806267
00:13:26,267 --> 00:13:29,055
Hattori-kun, you know how to talk to sparrows?

812251
00:13:32,251 --> 00:13:34,328
They say they saw a lot of chestnut trees over there

814368
00:13:34,368 --> 00:13:35,464
Really?

815824
00:13:35,824 --> 00:13:38,378
They say there are some in the woods
not far past the shrine

818439
00:13:38,439 --> 00:13:39,618
Great, let's go quickly!

819906
00:13:39,906 --> 00:13:41,185
Kagechiyo, did you hear that?

821226
00:13:41,226 --> 00:13:42,453
I heard it...

824124
00:13:44,124 --> 00:13:46,864
Your disguise really is a bit of a mishmash

826925
00:13:46,925 --> 00:13:49,545
Come on, let's head out

831046
00:13:51,046 --> 00:13:53,139
Yan...

836332
00:13:56,332 --> 00:13:57,573
Is something wrong?

837613
00:13:57,613 --> 00:13:59,327
Nothing, it's fine, let's go

839367
00:13:59,367 --> 00:14:01,193
Alright, let's hurry then

844722
00:14:04,722 --> 00:14:06,292
Hey, let's take a shortcut, okay?

846332
00:14:06,332 --> 00:14:07,372
Okay, okay

849579
00:14:09,579 --> 00:14:11,920
If we take the shortcut from here, it'll be faster

851960
00:14:11,960 --> 00:14:12,920
Sounds good

859909
00:14:19,909 --> 00:14:24,632
Maybe people who came before left arrows for us to follow

866138
00:14:26,138 --> 00:14:28,279
The arrows seem a bit strange

872618
00:14:32,618 --> 00:14:34,458
That's right, go this way

879216
00:14:39,216 --> 00:14:40,376
This way!

884732
00:14:44,732 --> 00:14:46,804
Oh no, what happened to you guys?

886844
00:14:46,844 --> 00:14:49,584
-Help...
-Help...

889624
00:14:49,624 --> 00:14:52,085
Which villain did this? How outrageous!

892126
00:14:52,126 --> 00:14:54,616
Stop talking and hurry and save me...

903084
00:15:03,084 --> 00:15:05,552
Hattori-kun, can you pull a little more gently?

905593
00:15:05,593 --> 00:15:06,500
Sorry

906540
00:15:06,540 --> 00:15:08,879
I wanted to save you guys, so I was a bit rough

911229
00:15:11,229 --> 00:15:13,203
Huh? It's a chestnut leaf

913810
00:15:13,810 --> 00:15:16,243
That means the chestnut trees are just ahead

916423
00:15:16,423 --> 00:15:17,597
Exactly

917638
00:15:17,638 --> 00:15:20,091
Enough talk, let's hurry, come on

924628
00:15:24,628 --> 00:15:27,447
This time Hattori-kun and the others are in for some real bad luck

927488
00:15:27,488 --> 00:15:29,301
Yeah... in for some real bad luck

929441
00:15:29,441 --> 00:15:31,494
Alright, let's hurry and set things up

935358
00:15:35,358 --> 00:15:36,626
Mister!

936733
00:15:36,733 --> 00:15:37,647
Mister

937708
00:15:37,708 --> 00:15:39,512
I have something to tell you

939847
00:15:39,847 --> 00:15:41,119
Is that so...

943787
00:15:43,787 --> 00:15:45,872
Wow, so many chestnut trees!

947953
00:15:47,953 --> 00:15:50,672
It even says "Pick all you want"!

950792
00:15:50,792 --> 00:15:54,805
-Yay...
-Yay...

958676
00:15:58,676 --> 00:16:00,616
Wow, awesome...

961345
00:16:01,345 --> 00:16:02,990
So many...

963031
00:16:03,031 --> 00:16:04,337
Oh, this is great...

964378
00:16:04,378 --> 00:16:05,502
Yan...

970775
00:16:10,775 --> 00:16:13,193
Ouch, that hurts...

973853
00:16:13,853 --> 00:16:14,701
You rascals!

974741
00:16:14,741 --> 00:16:17,180
What is your whole gang doing on my farm?

977765
00:16:17,765 --> 00:16:18,842
Mis...

978882
00:16:18,882 --> 00:16:20,825
Mister, we came to pick chestnuts

980866
00:16:20,866 --> 00:16:23,185
What did you say? Who gave you permission to do that?

983225
00:16:23,225 --> 00:16:25,479
It's written right here, look

989962
00:16:29,962 --> 00:16:31,282
Mine are for selling!

991522
00:16:31,522 --> 00:16:32,872
No it's not, run!

992912
00:16:32,912 --> 00:16:35,352
I knew it all along, you came to steal chestnuts!

995392
00:16:35,392 --> 00:16:37,046
Run...

999137
00:16:39,137 --> 00:16:40,843
Oh no, we've been tricked!

1002650
00:16:42,650 --> 00:16:44,671
Kenichi, don't worry about me, hurry and run first

1005898
00:16:45,898 --> 00:16:48,775
Ah, help...

1009131
00:16:49,131 --> 00:16:50,224
It hurts so much

1016075
00:16:56,075 --> 00:16:57,101
You can't get away!

1017141
00:16:57,141 --> 00:16:58,848
Kemumaki, you're so despicable!

1018888
00:16:58,888 --> 00:17:00,547
Shut up, take this!

1025852
00:17:05,852 --> 00:17:07,408
Ah, help!

1036200
00:17:16,200 --> 00:17:18,372
Shishimaru, hurry and stop him crying!

1038406
00:17:18,406 --> 00:17:20,766
I know, jeez, shut up!

1051015
00:17:31,015 --> 00:17:34,282
Shinzo's crying really is the most powerful in the whole world

1060151
00:17:40,151 --> 00:17:41,345
Hey, kid

1065506
00:17:45,506 --> 00:17:46,926
You're amazing

1067040
00:17:47,040 --> 00:17:49,345
Wow, thanks to your big crying fit

1069386
00:17:49,386 --> 00:17:51,036
I didn't have to waste time picking chestnuts

1071076
00:17:51,076 --> 00:17:52,138
To thank you all

1072179
00:17:52,179 --> 00:17:54,223
you can pick and eat all the chestnuts you want

1074264
00:17:54,264 --> 00:17:56,278
Oh, mister, really?

1076992
00:17:56,992 --> 00:17:58,286
Hooray...

1078327
00:17:58,327 --> 00:18:00,212
This trip was truly worth it

1080252
00:18:00,252 --> 00:18:03,112
Mister, I thought you were really stingy earlier

1083152
00:18:03,152 --> 00:18:04,825
Why'd you say I was stingy?

1085582
00:18:05,582 --> 00:18:06,630
Look at this

1086982
00:18:06,982 --> 00:18:08,022
Huh, what's this?

1088075
00:18:08,075 --> 00:18:10,866
Turns out someone scared us on purpose, it's Kemumaki!

1091294
00:18:11,294 --> 00:18:12,726
No...

1092966
00:18:12,966 --> 00:18:13,639
What are you...

1095459
00:18:15,459 --> 00:18:16,121
Oh no...

1096162
00:18:16,162 --> 00:18:19,211
What goes around really does come around!
